WEBVTT

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:34.450
Dear brother, what are you doing here?!

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:38.200
I finished my work sooner than I expected.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:43.660
So I set out on a swift steed, thinking
I could still make the ceremony in time.

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:48.920
It's hard getting a read on the
room after just bursting in here.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.840
Ninym, help.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.210
Well,

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:57.760
it seems that Prince Demetrio
and my sister shall be married.

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:00.720
I see no reason why I should not...

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.390
Married?!

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:35.980
Hold up. They're to marry?

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:40.070
What?! Why would you
even ask my sister that?

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:42.240
Let's see here. Oh, I see.

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:44.580
In response to his proposal, Falanya said

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.750
she would have to ask me first.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.290
The discussion has been bogged down since.

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:51.710
Terrible timing on my part!

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:59.970
What a pleasant surprise. I did not
expect to see <i>you </i>here, Prince Wein.

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:02.760
Princess Falanya,
your lord brother is here.

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:07.520
I trust you won't object to him
deciding whether we shall wed?

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.850
Yes, that is correct.

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:14.860
Then without further ado, I wish
to hear your thoughts on our union.

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:18.320
That said, I'd be shocked
if you had any objections.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:26.080
Of course, you have my full support!

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:27.830
If it comes to fruition,

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:31.540
the ties between the empire
and Natra will further strengthen!

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.500
It shall be the cornerstone
of a union between our lands.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:37.050
Are you not proud, dear sister?!

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:41.550
My, what joyous tidings.

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:47.930
To think we would marry two members
of Earthwold's imperial house.

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:48.890
What?

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:52.100
Is this not a pleasant surprise,
Princess Lowellmina?

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:54.060
Indeed it is.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:59.530
My betrothal to Prince Wein was
put on hold during the failed rebellion.

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:03.740
But is this not a fine opportunity
to resume the talk of marriage?

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:08.830
If my prince and I wed,
and you marry the princess,

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:13.540
Natra's influence within
the empire will be tremendous.

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:15.670
"You owe me one, Wein."

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:19.960
My sister and I can hardly wait
to join the imperial family.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:24.380
"Don't be stupid. <i>You </i>own <i>me</i>
for all the times I saved your behind."
If I'm not careful, I may end up
entertaining perilous ambitions.

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:25.550
"Consider that debt paid
by saving your little sister."

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:28.390
"Consider that debt paid
by saving your little sister."
My dear Prince Wein,
please behave yourself.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:33.640
But you are most certainly a great man
with many accomplishments under your belt.

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:38.610
I suppose the people of Earthwold, too,
may expect great things from you.

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:41.480
E-Enough! This I can't abide, Lowellmina!

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.070
You dare act on your own?!

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:44.610
On my own?

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:47.820
Imperial marriages are
the emperor's prerogative.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:53.910
But since no one sits on the throne,
I see nothing wrong with acting on my own.

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:59.420
As you yourself said, dear brother,
"You keep out of this."

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:02.590
Is this really any of your business?

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:05.800
Well, what will it be?

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:11.560
Natra's influence within the empire will
expand tremendously with both marriages.

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:17.520
Personally handing us such influence
has to be the last thing you want to do.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:21.900
With all due respect, Your Highness,

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:27.320
Natra traditionally forbids its royals
from marrying into the same family.

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:30.740
Oops. I had forgotten about that.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:33.450
She just made that up.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:36.000
Nice ad-lib, Ninym!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:40.040
What say you, Prince Demetrio?
Shall we not ponder the matter

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:43.510
and then revisit it again tomorrow?

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:45.510
W-Well...

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:48.890
I'm not opposed
to continuing our talks today.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:52.470
But if that's what you wish,
I shall defer to your judgment.

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:57.230
I am grateful for your consideration.
Let us meet again, Prince Demetrio.

00:05:57.230 --> 00:06:00.860
Very well. Let us speak
of this when next we meet.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:06.610
Now that that is settled,
I must beg your leave.

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:11.620
Wein! That was a big surprise!

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:14.040
You showed up out of the blue!

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.290
You made my day!

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:21.250
I was worried about you,
but I see it was all for nothing.

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:24.210
You did well, Falanya.
I'm so proud of you.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:32.680
What will you do about
Prince Demetrio's proposal?

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:35.640
Well, we're members of a royal family.

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:39.230
As such, political marriages
are unavoidable.

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:44.400
That's why we must
choose our partners wisely.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:48.780
I've no intention of handing you
over to a man like that.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:54.030
If he wants your hand in marriage,
he must at least unify the continent.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:59.040
Wein! That means I'll never marry him.

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:04.380
And? Are you sure it was
a good idea to come here?

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:09.260
I finished off all I had to do.
Things should be fine back home for now.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:13.260
Plus, I'm concerned about
what the Levetians will do next.

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:14.800
The Levetian religion?

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:18.100
I don't know what they're up to,

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:21.690
but they're working
behind the scenes in every land.

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:25.320
With Mealtars about to be
absorbed into the empire,

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:28.360
they'll no doubt try to interfere--

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:30.150
Are you all right?!

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:35.120
I think I've been overdoing it.
And I haven't been getting enough sleep.

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:37.490
But no need to worry.

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:40.500
Tell me, what's the situation on your end?

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:44.920
Nothing to be concerned about.
But I was asked to give you this.

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:46.090
What is it?

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:49.130
Lowa wants to invite you
to a secret meeting.

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:00.980
So, what did you want to talk about?

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:05.110
I don't know if "talk" is the right word.

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:07.820
It's more like I need advice or
someone to listen to me complain.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.570
Complain. Right...

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:12.610
Well, I have a pretty
good idea what it is.

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:17.780
You wanted your brothers to decide
who the next emperor would be.

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.700
Why would you think that?

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:25.330
The summit won't decide who is emperor.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:30.010
Its true purpose is to parade
the empire's influence for all to see

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:33.550
and strengthen our factions
by gathering powerful allies.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:35.840
Anyone could see that.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:40.140
True. Bardloche, Manfred,
and even Demetrio

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:42.930
don't believe they'll reach a decision.

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:46.480
You still hoped you might have a chance,

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:49.070
but you haven't declared
your interest in the throne.

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:52.150
You're not even seen
as a viable candidate yet.

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:55.530
My efforts have been clumsy.

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:58.410
It seems I was anxious for nothing.

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:02.790
The empire's subjects have already
abandoned the three princes.

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:07.670
Unless something happens,
Lowa will one day be elevated to empress.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:12.800
But right now, there are some
who fear the empty throne.

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:17.050
She's chosen to ignore such fears
and wait for her moment to shine.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:21.390
She has worried and worried,
pondered and pondered

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:25.060
until she decided to place
all her hope in the Summit of Heirs.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:29.060
Wein, I'd appreciate
some encouraging words.

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:30.860
I'm drawing a blank.

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:34.900
All right, then let's hear
your honest opinion about me.

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:37.280
Honestly, you've been stupid.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:38.410
How dare you.

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:42.580
Don't feel so blue.
After all, you've a lot to think about.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:46.330
And for what it's worth,
I wouldn't mind lending a hand.

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:57.180
We should go before prying eyes
notice we've been gone.

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:00.550
Wein?

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:01.810
What?

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:06.310
I <i>will </i>get you all mixed up
in my epic tale.

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:08.190
And I <i>will </i>win, you'll see.

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:10.980
I see.

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:13.440
Prince Wein is here in Mealtars.

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:17.360
It seems he will be holding talks
with Prince Demetrio tomorrow.

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:20.200
What is your opinion of him,
Your Highness?

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:23.660
He's an exceptional man,
almost too much so.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:27.750
He was so exceptional, his grades were
wiped from the academy's records.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.710
He has been ruling Natra well as regent

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:33.710
and has all the makings of a great man.

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:35.670
So then...

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:38.010
We'll kill him.

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:42.350
Get rid of him during
his talks with Demetrio.

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:43.560
Yes, Highness!

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:51.730
I'll have to swiftly eliminate all
who oppose me after I become emperor.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:57.320
What's wrong?

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:59.700
Nothing, just a little sleepy.

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.950
Wein, if you're too tired--

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:05.330
No, this is nothing I can't handle.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:10.170
It should be all downhill
once these talks are over.

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:11.790
I sure hope that's the case.

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:14.880
By the way, I haven't seen
Falanya for a while.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:17.550
The princess is at the
Citizen's Assembly again.

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:22.800
Next, I would like
to debate tax rate issues.

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:25.560
--You want to hear more?
--Tax money must first be
allocated to public roads.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:28.680
--Please accept this, Your Highness.
--No, there is no need for that.

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:29.730
Good day.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:34.230
At first, I thought you were humoring us,
but I've seen how intently you've watched.

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:38.360
If Your Highness is interested,
would you not join the deliberations?

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.950
I would be delighted!

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:44.620
I've been waiting for you, Prince Wein.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:47.330
I've had this venue prepared for us.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:50.370
I do hope you seek constructive talks?

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:55.250
But of course. I have the greatest
of hopes, Prince Demetrio.

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:59.630
He either sees Natra's worth in a
new light and wishes to mend relations,

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:04.340
or he has mapped out a plan for
selling me on the matter of marriage.

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:06.600
Now, let's see which it is.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:16.690
Wait! Stay right there.

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:19.690
W-Was there something else I might do?

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:22.030
Did you prepare this tea?

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:23.660
Yes, I did.

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:24.950
Drink it.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.410
Me?!

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:27.280
That's right.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:31.160
I am afraid that is the choicest of teas.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:34.790
It is reserved solely
for people of high standing.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.880
One such as I could not possibly--

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:39.670
I told you to drink it!

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:47.300
I was wondering what's going on.
You think the tea is poisoned?

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:49.970
That is ridiculous.

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:53.060
You lack even the courage
to drink tea when invited to talk.

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:57.560
And then you hurl accusations?
That really <i>is </i>hilarious.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:13:01.030
I don't understand people who
are impressed by a coward like you.

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:02.820
No, wait!

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:09.410
Well, Prince Wein? Satisfied now?

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:13.910
The idea that this
tea is poisoned... is...

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:15.040
Your Highness!

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:19.540
Ninym, wait! We need a doctor first!

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:21.710
--Find one!
--Understood.

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:32.100
"Several days later"

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:35.730
"Several days later"
Let's go over everything you said happened
while I was held for questioning.

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:38.100
Let's go over everything you said happened
while I was held for questioning.

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:41.110
Demetrio managed to barely survive

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:43.860
but sped off to convalesce in his domain.

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:49.200
Bardloche and Manfred denounced the
poisoning attempt as a plot by Mealtars

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.330
and encircled the city with their troops.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:56.620
Lowellmina and Falanya worked with
Cosimo in an effort to calm the situation.

00:13:56.620 --> 00:14:01.960
Meanwhile, I was held till today
as a suspect in the failed poisoning.

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:04.260
So, what do we do now?

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:06.130
We return to Natra.

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:07.930
Not much else we could do.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:11.640
We'll need a plan for a quick escape,
or we're in trouble.

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:14.220
If anything worse were to happen--

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:16.020
Pardon me, Highness!

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:19.060
Bursting in without knocking
is bad manners back home.

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:22.610
Forgive me, but time is of the essence!

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:25.650
Well? Have the princes'
armies commenced their siege?

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:27.280
No!

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:30.660
We received word of an army
flying the Levetians' banner.

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:33.120
It's approaching Mealtars from the west!

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:34.410
Huh?

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:44.960
Mealtars will be freed
from imperial oppression.

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:48.510
The time of holy war is upon us.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:53.890
I just hope this pleases Prince Wein.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:57.640
I'm too damn busy for you
to be showing up right now!

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:59.850
You are seriously, seriously...

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:02.310
We were trying to
figure out how to escape!

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:04.360
I don't have time for you!

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:05.650
I mean, seriously!

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:08.950
What the hell, Caldmellia?!

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.240
Wein, calm yourself.

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:13.070
How is that even possible?!

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:18.080
The princes' siege lines are causing
considerable stress on the population.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.750
Add to that the Levetians' army,

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:24.290
and it won't be long
before riots break out in the city.

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:28.050
Mealtars' population numbers about 30,000.

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:31.840
It will be impossible for
the city guard to keep the peace.

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:37.560
Then the army will have an excuse to
intervene, and all hell will break loose.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:41.190
We must escape before then,
or we'll really be in danger.

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:42.310
Wein?

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:44.150
Sorry.

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:47.480
I'm feeling kind of exhausted.

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:49.110
I'll just lie down and...

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:53.160
Wein! Wein! Wein!

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:06.800
If riots break out now...

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:13.840
That would be awful!

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:17.140
If my brother were well,
I know what he would do!

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:21.310
Where are you going, Your Highness?

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:23.400
The Citizen's Assembly.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:25.730
Crowds pose too great a risk!

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:27.480
I know.

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:28.530
However...

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:34.570
The empire's tyranny knows no bounds!
We should side with the west!

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:37.370
You think we should seek help
from the Levetians?!

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:40.750
It's obvious they're only
here for Mealtars' riches!

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:43.080
Then our only choice is
to bow to the empire.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:46.330
If we do that,
we'll lose our right of self-rule!

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.210
Shut your mouth!

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:50.050
Mayor Cosimo.

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:55.180
The venerable Citizen's Assembly
of Mealtars has devolved into this.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:16:59.680
I've had enough!

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:02.100
There's no point in debating anything now!

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:05.770
He's right! It's every man for himself!

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:17.870
Be careful, Falanya.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:27.580
Members of the assembly,
this city is in dire straits.

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:35.010
Falanya.

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:40.180
It cannot survive a battle
against the empire at this time.

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:43.430
But does that mean this
must be the end for Mealtars?

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:55.400
No. There is a way forward.

00:17:55.400 --> 00:18:00.120
You are the merchants of Mealtars,
the continent's greatest mercantile city.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:05.750
Merchants use their knowledge
to build a better future.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:09.750
If the merchants of this
city of 30,000 work together

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:14.550
to solve a problem,
there is nothing you cannot overcome.

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:18.050
What you need is solidarity!

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:22.600
You have some of the
brightest minds in the land!

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:27.190
We need your brilliance
to light the path forward!

00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:44.830
Ninym, give me an update.

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:47.540
Wein!

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:50.250
I'm so glad you finally woke.

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:54.960
But I might collapse again
from your body blow.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:58.430
I'm sorry I didn't notice
you were struggling.

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:01.340
I knew you were tired, but...

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:03.560
What a relief.

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:06.890
I don't know what I'd do
if you never woke again.

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:10.400
Come on, don't cry.

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:14.980
I don't know what to do
when you're like this.

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:17.320
Then don't overdo it again.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:22.700
Well, it's kind of hard to promise that.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:24.030
Ow!

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:29.910
All right. I'll take better care
of myself, so cut me some slack.

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:31.210
No can do.

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:34.630
So let's just stay
like this a little longer.

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:42.470
Wein!

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:44.760
What a relief. I was so worried about you!

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:48.140
Sorry to worry you, Falanya.
But I'm all right now.

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:53.690
Ninym told me about how well
you did while I was unconscious.

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:57.070
It was nothing compared
to what you've done.

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:02.490
Is there something else I could help with?

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:05.370
There is.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:11.290
And it's something only you could do.

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:15.960
Is Mealtars no more than a highway
through the center of the continent?

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.800
No, it's not.

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:22.130
So then, is it a city upon that highway?

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:24.430
That's not it, either.

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:27.720
Mealtars is you, its people!

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:32.520
You are what makes
a city of merchants possible.

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:37.900
As such, this is not an evacuation.
It is a march toward victory.

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:42.450
Cast off the past, for the time
of your new glory is upon you!

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:44.780
Together we shall march forward!

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:46.620
--Together!
--Together!

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:47.830
To victory!

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:49.740
To new glory!

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:51.790
--We march!
--We march!

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.750
Wein, this could work.

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:57.210
Yes, it's up to us now.

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:15.310
We'll use this momentum to launch
a wave of 30,000 people,

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:18.520
thereby evacuating everyone
from this city!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.660
What is this?

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:27.450
What's happening?

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:29.410
P-Princess Falanya?!

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:32.200
What is she doing?!

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:54.980
There are some 30,000!
All of Mealtars seeks our protection.

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:57.150
They're headed this way!

00:22:00.360 --> 00:22:02.280
There is nothing to fear!

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:06.320
Where we go, a new road
shall open up before us!

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:12.080
You are a most astonishing
young lady, Your Highness.

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:13.580
This is a pleasant surprise.

00:22:13.580 --> 00:22:16.710
"King Gruyere of Soljest"
One might say, almost too pleasant.

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:19.080
What now, Caldmellia?

00:22:19.080 --> 00:22:23.340
We are not prepared to take in
and provide for 30,000 people.

00:22:23.340 --> 00:22:24.920
King Gruyere.

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:28.640
This is certainly a quandary.

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:33.470
If there is anything that troubles you,
I will gladly give counsel.

00:22:33.470 --> 00:22:37.850
Lady Caldmellia, King Gruyere.
So nice to see you again.
